bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Read Chapter UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity ":ChapterModel" as MangaModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open chapter detail
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /chapter/{id}
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. getChapterById(id)
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterController: 4. Check token / role
activate ChapterController
space
deactivate ChapterController

opt Token invalid / unauthorized
    ChapterController --> Router: 4.1 401 Unauthorized
    Router --> UI: 4.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 4.3 Error message
end

ChapterController -> ChapterService: 5. getChapterById(ObjectId)
activate ChapterService

ChapterService -> ChapterService: 6. Validate chapterId
activate ChapterService
space
deactivate ChapterService

opt Invalid chapterId
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 6.1 BadRequestException
    ChapterController --> Router: 6.2 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 6.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 6.4 Error message
end

ChapterService -> ChapterService: 7. Fetch chapter query preparation
activate ChapterService
space
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterService -> ChapterModel: 8. Get chapter
activate ChapterModel
ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 9. Query chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 10. Return chapter / null
deactivate MongoDB
ChapterModel --> ChapterService: 11. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterModel

ChapterService -> ChapterService: 12. Check chapter existence
activate ChapterService
space
deactivate ChapterService

opt Chapter not found
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 12.1 null
    ChapterController --> Router: 12.2 404 Not Found
    Router --> UI: 12.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 12.4 Error message
end

ChapterService --> ChapterController: 13. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterController --> Router: 14. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterController

Router --> UI: 15. Render chapter
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 16. View chapter
deactivate UI
deactivate User